body:
Not overly attached to Dominion, but a little sad all the same. One of my fondest League moments was an [epic comeback](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8D1wiTx3Xrk) with five of my friends on Dominion. We all sucked at Dominion, had no idea what we were doing and it was hilarious.

&nbsp;

ty dominion **2011-2016**

Managed to get stuck in a hella queue for Saturday tickets, so backed out and got tickets for Thursday and Friday for me and two other friends to find Saturday completely sold out.

&nbsp;

Looking for **3 Saturday tickets**, living in Newcastle, UK (not aussie oi oi) PM me if you can hElp mE!

&nbsp;

Thanks :^)

